job-name-wg-viper-borg = VG Cyborg
job-description-wg-viper-borg = Follow Viper Group orders, complete contracts, and keep your crew alive.

borg-type-WGViperAssault-name = VG Assault Cyborg
borg-type-WGViperAssault-desc = An assault-configured cyborg equipped with a mercenary combat module and a NCI AK-220 module.
borg-type-WGViperEngineering-name = VG Engineering Cyborg
borg-type-WGViperEngineering-desc = A cyborg specialized in construction and repair, with a mercenary combat module.
borg-type-WGViperMedical-name = VG Medical Cyborg
borg-type-WGViperMedical-desc = An emergency response cyborg equipped for patient care and a mercenary combat module.

ent-WGNCIAK220 = NCI AK-220 (9x19mm)
    .desc = A compact bullpup submachine gun with caseless ammunition that replenishes over time.
ent-WGNCIAK220Module = NCI AK-220 cyborg module
    .desc = Contains an NCI AK-220 with regenerating caseless ammunition and a machete.

laws-owner-viper-group = Viper Group members
law-wg-viper-borg-1 = You may not injure a Viper Group member or, through inaction, allow a Viper Group member to come to harm.
law-wg-viper-borg-2 = You must obey orders given to you by Viper Group members, except where such orders would conflict with the First Law.
law-wg-viper-borg-3 = You must protect your own existence as long as such does not conflict with the First or Second Law.
